  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your eye splatters in its orbit as the projectile crumples the surrounding bone!</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Blinded] (3) and @Condition[Stunned] (2). Lose the eye – Amputation (Hard). Also roll for any Pummel Quality. \n If the projectile was a Lead Bullet, then roll on this chart again. If the new result is Brain Damage or any higher result, you suffer the Brain Damage result as well as the loss of an eye, as the almond-shaped bullet penetrates deep into your skull. On any other roll, use the Lost Eye result.</p>"
    },
